# Prismari Charm, first mode: "Surveil 2, then draw a card." (CR 701.25a). Bot1 looks at the top two cards, Lightning Bolt
# and Counterspell, puts Lightning Bolt into the graveyard and keeps Counterspell on top, so the draw that follows the surveil
# takes Counterspell and not Mana Leak (the third card), which proves the surveil is finished before the draw.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Prismari Charm
Island x4
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Mana Leak
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Prismari Charm.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Surveil 2)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Counterspell | Lightning Bolt)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Prismari Charm; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Counterspell
Bot1.Library.Count = 11
Bot1.Library = Mana Leak; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
